---
import Button from "./Button.astro";
---

<section id="open-source" class="scroll-mt-8 py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl items-center gap-10 rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-8 py-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-14">
    <div>
      <h2>Open source.<br />Yours to run.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-muted">
        The server, CLI and apps are all on GitHub. Put the server on Railway, a VPS, or right next to your agent on
        exe.dev. Push notifications still work, and your messages never touch our servers.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <Button href="https://github.com/joshuaKnauber/rply">View on GitHub</Button>
        <Button href="/self-host/" variant="secondary">Self-host it →</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-ink p-5 font-mono text-small text-neutral-300">
      <p><span class="text-neutral-500">$</span> npx @rply/cli init https://rply.your.server</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-500">Channel "SEO bot" created.</p>
      <p class="text-neutral-500">Scan the QR code or open the link to pair:</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-accent-300">https://rply.your.server/pair?c=K7QX-M2PD</p>
      <p class="mt-4"><span class="text-neutral-500">$</span> rply send "Hello from the agent"</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
